/ Metadata variables a design still uses (see Nuntius::MetadataVariables), with what to do about them
- if variables.any?
  .col-span-12.rounded-md.border.border-amber-200.bg-amber-50.px-3.py-2.text-sm.text-amber-800 role="status"
    p.mb-1 = message
    ul.list-disc.pl-5
      - variables.each do |variable, value|
        li
          code = "{{ #{variable} }}"
          - if value.present?
            =< t("nuntius.admin.shared.metadata_variables.value_html", value: tag.code(value))
    p.mt-1 = t("nuntius.admin.shared.metadata_variables.instead")
